  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planning Grant aiming to develop an education in entrepreneurship and knowledge on how to start new businesses with the goal to train professional contractors that with speed and precision can assess, develop and create scalable business.Identify a location and strategic partners to establish one or several business labs in Namibia.</narrative>
